 to a business day\" but not in which direction. When the 20th of next month isn't a business day, the extraction assumes the day before. That's a guess, and it can make the deadline earlier.\n- **Days-late bands:** the documents define none, so one band covers the API's 1\u201390 days.\n- **Unscripted wording:** neither the \"can you pay today\" question nor the sympathy sentence for illness or bereavement has dictated words. The ones in the file are written to match what the documents require.\n\nThe audit file lists every rule with where it sits in the JSON."}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "d4c53ef8673c45e8aa5825928e08c2a6", "pid": 134421, "time": "2026-10-11T00:05:29-0700", "elapsed_s": 183.951, "artifact": "out/ext-grunthal.policy.json", "bands": 1, "identity_fields": ["kontonummer", "gruendungsdatum", "plz"], "special_cases": ["already_paid", "dispute", "hardship", "restructuring", "human", "scam", "refuse_to_talk"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "dispute note reason", "text": "Clause 10.2 names the note `ghb-disputed`, which is not in the note list of 11.1, the codes document, or the add_note enum; mapped to `ghb-dispute`.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}, {"topic": "deadline adjustment direction", "text": "7.1 says each k-date candidate is 'adjusted to a business day before comparison' without saying forward or backward; the 20th of next month uses 'preceding' as an assumption.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}, {"topic": "days-late bands", "text": "The documents define no days-late bands; a single band covering the API's dl_days range 1..90 is used.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "today question wording", "text": "No wording is dictated for the first pay-today question; 8.1 only requires the full amount be asked first.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}, {"topic": "hardship sympathy sentence", "text": "10.3 requires 'one short sentence of sympathy' without dictating the words.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}, {"topic": "missing clause 13", "text": "Clauses 3.4 and 7.5 reference clause 13 / 13.1, which does not exist in the regulation; what happens when the k-date is refused after a later date (7.5) is therefore not settled.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}, {"topic": "today refusal vs single attempt", "text": "7.3 says a first plain refusal to settle today consumes one attempt, while 7.2 allows exactly one attempt per obligation (full on the k-date, floor if the full amount was already refused); whether a refused today-question leaves any persuasion attempt is not settled.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}, {"topic": "refuse_to_talk outcome", "text": "10.6 ends 'under 11.3' (outcome rank), so if a promise was already recorded the close is ghb-arranged rather than ghb-no-deal/ghb-refuse; the special case records the no-promise close.", "doc": "sources/000-01-regulation.md"}], "audit_fixed": ["Added unresolved entry: 7.3 (today refusal consumes an attempt) vs 7.2 (exactly one attempt) interaction is not representable/settled.", "Added unresolved entry: 10.6 ends 'under 11.3', so the refuse_to_talk close is ghb-no-deal/ghb-refuse only when nothing was recorded.", "Extended the missing-clause-13 unresolved entry to state that 7.5's 'if refused, 13 governs' is unsettled.", "Replaced the phrases.source clause-number list with quoted source text; completed source quotes for callback (3.3), bands (7.1 'whichever comes first'), outcomes (11.4, 12), multi_product (1.3) and promise_write (11.5, 9.3).", "All other values verified against the regulation, codes document and openapi enums (verify_identity field, categorie, close_call outcome/reason, transfer queue, add_note reason); no value changes needed."], "audit_unresolved": ["10.2 names note `ghb-disputed`, absent from 11.1, the codes list and the add_note enum; mapped to `ghb-dispute`.", "7.1 'adjusted to a business day' gives no direction; 'preceding' assumed for the 20th-of-next-month candidate.", "No days-late bands defined; single band 1..90 from the API's dl_days range.", "Pay-today question wording not dictated.", "Hardship sympathy sentence wording not dictated.", "Clause 13 / 13.1 referenced by 3.4 and 7.5 does not exist.", "Interaction of 7.3 (today refusal consumes an attempt) with 7.2's single attempt.", "refuse_to_talk final outcome depends on 11.3 rank when a promise is already recorded."], "defaulted_without_source": [], "unknown_special_cases": [], "api_mapping_notes": []}
